   3  5  6 	1	180.0	13.5 ; trans double bond
   5  6  7 	1      180.0	13.5   ; can be used with CBT dihedral potential, fitted from charmm36 reference
   6  7  8 	1      180.0	13.5   ; can be used with CBT dihedral potential, fitted from charmm36 reference
   4  9 10 	1	180.0	13.5
   9 10 11 	1      180.0	13.5   ; across a beads containing a double bond in the first/third bead
  10 11 12 	1      140.0	10.0   ; one unsaturation
  11 12 13 	1      180.0	13.5   ; identical to a_C1_C1_C1 to improve transition temperatures of singly unsaturated lipids

